133	    /**
134	     * The owner's membership number, formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where YY is the
135	     * last two digits of the registration date's year (e.g. {@code 'SMI-0007-M26'}). Derived
136	     * from the owner's own fields; absent until both the customer code and registration date
137	     * have been assigned.
